        "nobel_worthiness": "Optical lattice clocks have transformed time and frequency metrology, providing an exceptionally precise and broadly enabling measurement platform.",
        "attribution": "Katori pioneered the lattice-clock concept and realization; Ye made decisive independent experimental advances toward high-performance clocks.",
        "maturity": "The method has been reproduced extensively, reaches extraordinary performance, and enables applications from fundamental tests to geodesy.",
        "uncertainties": [
