      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "The quantum cascade laser established a fundamentally new semiconductor-laser architecture with major scientific and technological consequences.",
        "attribution": "Capasso and Faist are closely associated with the invention and first realization; Cho's heterostructure engineering was an important enabling foundation.",
        "maturity": "QCLs are robust, commercially and scientifically important sources, particularly across the mid-infrared and terahertz regions.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The relative case for including the foundational semiconductor-growth contribution requires careful historical assessment."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
