      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "SASE X-ray free-electron lasers created unprecedented ultrafast, coherent X-ray probes and changed what can be measured at atomic scales.",
        "attribution": "Pellegrini drove the experimental program, while Saldin and Kim made major theoretical and design contributions to high-gain FEL operation.",
        "maturity": "Multiple facilities now provide mature user operations and have delivered a very large body of scientific results.",
        "uncertainties": [
