        "nobel_worthiness": "Squeezed-light methods made quantum noise a controllable experimental resource and have improved precision measurements, notably interferometric sensing.",
        "attribution": "Caves articulated the quantum-metrological significance; Kimble contributed foundational quantum-optics experiments; Schnabel led influential precision squeezed-light implementations.",
        "maturity": "Squeezing is a reproducible laboratory capability with demonstrated performance in demanding large-scale measurement systems.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The attribution spans distinct stages from theory through generation techniques to gravitational-wave-detector deployment."
        ]
      }
