        "nobel_worthiness": "Titanium-sapphire lasers and passive mode locking enabled broadly tunable, reliable femtosecond sources that became central tools in ultrafast science.",
        "attribution": "Moulton was crucial to titanium-sapphire laser development, while Keller and Sibbett made important contributions to practical passive mode-locking and ultrafast laser technology.",
        "maturity": "The technology has had decades of reproducible scientific impact and seeded diverse measurement and imaging applications.",
